000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. LITERAL2.
000030 DATA DIVISION.
000040 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000050 01  C-TEXT              PIC X(4).
000060 01  FLAG                PIC 1     VALUE B"1".
000070 01  BIG                 PIC 9(5).
000080 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000090     MOVE Z"ABC" TO C-TEXT
000100     DISPLAY "Z""ABC"" IS " FUNCTION LENGTH (Z"ABC") " BYTES LONG"
000110     IF C-TEXT (4:1) = LOW-VALUE
000120         DISPLAY "THE LAST BYTE IS A NULL (LOW-VALUE)"
000130     END-IF
000140     IF FLAG = B"1"
000150         DISPLAY "FLAG IS ON"
000160     END-IF
000170     COMPUTE BIG = 1.5E3
000180     DISPLAY "1.5E3 IS " BIG
000190     STOP RUN.
